{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StoreSubscriptionStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"StoreSubscriptionStatus","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:13RKPurchaseKit23StoreSubscriptionStatusV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StoreSubscriptionStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PurchaseKit"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StoreSubscriptionStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/MigratingTo4","doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/Subscriptions"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An entitlement only says “has access right now”. A status also says why access ended","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(billing failure, cancellation, refund), whether it is about to end, and what it renews","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into — what a paywall, a “your payment failed” banner, or a win-back screen needs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mirrors "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Product.SubscriptionInfo.Status"},{"type":"text","text":", which cannot be built outside StoreKit."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The renewal state of a subscription group for the current customer."}]},{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/subscriptionStatuses(inGroup:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns one status per subscription the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customer holds in a group - usually one, more with Family Sharing."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesProtocol\/subscriptionStatus(inGroup:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" picks the one that matters most: subscribed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first, then grace period, billing retry, expired and revoked, and the latest expiration date"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when two share a state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the status for what an entitlement check cannot tell you: that the subscription will not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"renew, that a payment is failing, or which plan it renews into."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["guard let status = try await PurchasesManager.shared","    .subscriptionStatus(inGroup: \"com.myapp.subscriptions.premium\") else {","    showPaywall()","    return","}","","switch status.state {","case .inGracePeriod, .inBillingRetryPeriod:","    showUpdatePaymentBanner(until: status.gracePeriodExpirationDate)","case .subscribed where !status.willAutoRenew:","    showResubscribeHint(endingOn: status.transaction.expirationDate)","default:","    break","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/isActive","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" while the customer should have access: subscribed or in a grace"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"period. During a billing retry period without a grace period, the App Store has already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"withdrawn the entitlement."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The renewal fields come from the signed renewal info. If it fails verification they read as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than trusting unverified data; a status whose transaction fails"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verification is left out entirely."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/State-swift.struct","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/ExpirationReason-swift.struct","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RawRepresentable"},{"type":"text","text":" structs, so a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"type":"text","text":" over them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"needs a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"default"},{"type":"text","text":" branch and a future StoreKit value does not break your build."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:Subscriptions"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/rkpurchasekit\/storesubscriptionstatus"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"State","identifiers":["doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/state-swift.property","doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/isActive","doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreSubscriptionStatus\/Stat